      "writtenOn": "2024-06-21T17:13:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are we observing the I2C transaction itself failing? Contention with another thread within the EC?\n\nIMO the loop should instead be:\n* Write to register\n* Wait 500ms for bootloader mode\n* Try to read the mode register to see if we succeeded (200ms timeout)\n* Loop again to try to enter bootloader mode.",
      "revId": "e56945531a789a120a48e2c473dd57b34ed749b2",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
