      "writtenOn": "2024-06-25T23:38:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I2C-level failure for sending the start command (returning -EIO). If the bus mutex is locked this thread will just block forever until it is released. I should take a saleae trace to see what\u0027s going on, but this is an effective workaround for now. The mode check is in a separate loop in case it takes longer than the published time to enter bootloader mode and we know at that point that the PDC acknowledged the TFUs command.",
      "parentUuid": "b357b171_8164c258",
